📄 Page 3: JiraTestPlanManager
🎯 Purpose

JiraTestPlanManager is responsible for resolving the correct Jira Test Plan key for the current suite.

Its main role is to decide between:

• reusing an existing Test Plan
• using a manually provided Test Plan key
• creating a new Test Plan

This class contains the business rules for Test Plan selection.

🧠 Why this class exists

Test Plan resolution is a business decision, not just a technical API call.

The integration needs to support several scenarios:

• use a fixed manually configured Test Plan
• reuse a previously saved Test Plan for the same suite
• validate whether the saved key is still correct
• search Jira for an existing matching Test Plan
• create a new one only when necessary

Centralizing these rules in a dedicated class keeps the flow easier to maintain.

🏗️ Position in the architecture

This class is used by JiraFlowCoordinator.

It depends on:

• JiraFlowCoordinator owner
• JiraGateway gateway

It does not call Katalon request objects directly. All Jira calls go through the gateway.

