Overview

The Update Test Plan endpoint is used to link a newly created Jira Test Execution to a resolved Jira Test Plan. This step happens after the XML results have already been imported and a valid execution key has been returned.

Purpose in the integration

Importing the XML creates the execution, but it does not automatically attach that execution to the intended Test Plan in the current flow. This endpoint makes that relationship explicit by adding the execution key to the target Test Plan, keeping the Jira/Xray structure organized.

